# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated results. Every .rds under results/ is reproducible from the
# committed code plus the canonical seeds in config/paired_grid.R, and the
# full grid is ~17 GB, so none of it is version-controlled.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/results/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Zebrafish real data — HELD BACK FOR THIS PRE-SUBMISSION SNAPSHOT.
#
# The source tables belong to the study of Gaulke et al. (2019). They are
# distributed publicly by the senior author at
# https://github.com/yuanjiang-osu/Comp-gLASSO (MIT), and the copies used here
# are byte-identical to that distribution — but we redistribute nothing until
# the arrangement is confirmed with every collaborator (see STATUS in README).
#
# The cleaning CODE and its documentation ARE committed
# (data/prepare_zebrafish.R, data/README.md); they regenerate everything below
# from the source tables. To publish the data later, delete this block and run
# `git add data/`.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/data/raw/
/data/zebrafish_clean.rds
/data/zebrafish_real_depths.rds

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Real-data DERIVED products of the same held-back cohort. These are estimation
# results rather than source data, but they name genera and pair them with
# infection group and sampling day, so they follow the same schedule as the
# data itself.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/analysis/tables/tab05_zeb_*
/analysis/figures/fig05_zeb_*
/results/zebrafish/

# R session junk
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
*.Rproj.user

# Rcpp build artifacts
*.o
*.so
*.dll

# atomic-save temp files
*.tmp.*

# OS
.DS_Store
